OL,2,V55555555COIL RIG BLOW FOR
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSCOTT LITHGOW
OL,5, BP has cancelled a #60m oil rig
OL,6, contract with the troubled Scott
OL,7, Lithgow shipyard on the Lower Clyde.
OL,9, The move could threaten the plan to
OL,10, save the yard from closure.
OL,12, BP said: "The rig is one year late and
OL,13, vastly over budget."
OL,15, The rig was due for delivery on
OL,16, February 28 1983 but will be ready on
OL,17, April 18 this year and the cost will
OL,18, be #80m, according to Scott Lithgow.
OL,20, Experts say the rig would not fetch
OL,21, anything like #60m on the open market.
OL,23,F]DFrom 27-02-84 / teletextarchive.com
