OL,2,V55555555CTUC THREAT TO BREAK
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CGOVERNMENT LINKS
OL,5, The TUC is considering breaking off
OL,6, all links with Government bodies
OL,7, because of the GCHQ union ban.
OL,9, The finance and general purposes
OL,10, committee is recommending a boycott
OL,11, of the March meeting of the NEDC and a
OL,12, review of all its Government links.
OL,14, The committee also wants to raise
OL,15, #500,000 by a 5p levy on union members
OL,16, to assist GCHQ staff.
OL,18, TUC general secretary Len Murray says
OL,19, it is not calling for a general strike
OL,20, tomorrow in support of GCHQ staff.
OL,22, But unions were being asked in a
OL,23, "reasoned way" to challenge the ban.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
