OL,2,V55555555CDAWN RAIDS IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSERIOUS CRIMES PROBE
OL,5, A number of people have been arrested
OL,6, following dawn raids by police on homes
OL,7, in London, Kent and Essex.
OL,9, Kent Police said the arrests related to
OL,10, robbery, aggravated burglary and other
OL,11, serious offences committed over the
OL,12, last two years.
OL,14, The raids, code-named Operation
OL,15, Mermaid, were made by 150 officers of
OL,16, Kent Police and Number Six Regional
OL,17, Crime Squad.
OL,19, They refused to say how many people had
OL,20, been arrested.
